## Learning Outcomes

* Built multiple supervised machine learning classification models.
* Compared different algorithms using standard evaluation metrics.
* Understood the importance of model evaluation and cross-validation.
* Selected the most suitable model for loan eligibility prediction.
* Saved the trained model for deployment in a Flask web application.

---

## Conclusion

Epic 4 successfully developed and evaluated multiple machine learning models for predicting loan eligibility. Through systematic comparison and validation, the most accurate model was selected and saved as a reusable `.pkl` file, enabling seamless integration into the Smart Lender web application for real-time loan approval prediction.

